# Forgejo — the keys stored in secrets.sops.json, one value each (`sopsgen
# apply` fills generated ones, `sopsedit` the rest). Values built from other
# secrets live in env.nix. Key set must match secrets.sops.json and
# tests/fixtures/stacks/forgejo.sops.json.
# Forgejo self-generates SECRET_KEY / INTERNAL_TOKEN / JWT into app.ini, so the
# cross-host OIDC secret is the only thing here.

